From u267c7c6c510dc8a2 at groups.google.com  Thu Aug 23 05:06:44 2012
From: u267c7c6c510dc8a2 at groups.google.com (Ian Fellows)
Date: Thu, 23 Aug 2012 05:06:44 +0000
Subject: Re: how to change reference category in logistic regression
Message-ID: <oAxrWODEJjA.nEleAS6vspMJ@deducer.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <oAxrWODEJjA.wlYtisvFp0UJ@deducer.groups.google.com>
References: <oAxrWODEJjA.wlYtisvFp0UJ@deducer.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/deducer/c/oAxrWODEJjA/m/nEleAS6vspMJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

enter the following into the console:

options("contrasts"=c(unordered="contr.SAS",ordered="contr.poly" ))

this will make all subsequent models use the last category as
reference by default. The following reverses the operation:

options("contrasts"=c(unordered="contr.treatment",ordered="contr.poly" ))

